OL,5,G1900 Take the Floor
OL,6,     FFor the very best in traditional
OL,7,     Fmusic, join Gary Innes for Take
OL,8,     Fthe Floor. We treat you to a great
OL,9,     Fband session from Sandy Nixon and
OL,10,     Fhis Scottish Dance Band.
OL,11,G2100 Piping Sounds
OL,12,     FEwen Henderson takes us on a
OL,13,     Fpiping tour of Uist, focusing on
OL,14,     Fthe pipers and the tunes of the
OL,15,     Fislands. Amoung the players are
OL,16,     FSeonaidh MacIntyre, Willie
OL,17,     FMorrison and Fred Morrison.
